<span class="text-gray-500">testorg</span><span class="text-gray-300 mx-0.5">/</span><span class="font-bold text-gray-900">widget</span><span class="text-gray-400 font-sans text-base font-normal ml-2">Settings</span>
</h1>
<p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">Release configuration for this project — triggers, policies and pipelines — and who outside the organisation can read it.</p>
